    "title": "Upon The Heavens [16:9 4K]",
    "description": "16:9 version of my Upon The Heavens portrait wallpaper. This didn't took me that long at all considering I did most of the work back in February. All I had to do is to adjust some of the particle systems and repaint the effects for the city. For the rest (the girl for example) I can just reuse them from the portrait version of this artwork. I did add some new stuff into the wallpaper but for the most part its very similar to the portrait version that I animated earlier in February.\n\nBig thanks to Asuki (you probably have seen some of his wallpapers in the recently approved wallpapers section) for providing me this extended version of the wallpaper even though there is no need for him to do that. He used A.I to expand the original portrait artwork into this 16:9 version, so you will probably see some repeating buildings in the background, but hopefully it still looks good enough.\n\nI hope you enjoy this wallpaper!\n\nMusic:\n\n[url=https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=FAYzmPCe2-o] AK - Pulses [/url]\n\nOriginal wallpaper can be found [url=https://www.pixiv.net/en/artworks/99850276] here [/url]\n\n[url=https://twitter.com/Nengoro2739] Artist's Twitter [/url]\n\n[url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=2935100291] Portrait version of the wallpaper that I animated [/url]\n\nUpdate 1: Changed the default value for taskbar mode to opaque\n\nUpdate 2: Added in a black layer at the bottom of the wallpaper so that you won't see beyond the edge of the wallpaper if your taskbar is clear but you set the taskbar mode to opaque\n\nUpdate 3: Added option to remove girl (disabled by default)\n\nUpdate 4: Reduced angular momentum for big shooting stars",
